    "created_at": "2016-03-31T09:42:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-31T09:42:06Z",
    "body": "So how does synchronously changing the size from x to y work with a concept of animation?\n\nAlso, when does the size change? Does it happen at the moment you invoke the method? For all documents? (What if those documents were in a different process?)\n",
