    "created_at": "2016-03-31T09:49:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-31T09:49:56Z",
    "body": "The size is changed at some moment which we probably cannot fully control, but we can do stuff when that happen. That's the point.\n\nWhen a document is in a different process, the parent process need to tell the child that its size should change, and we can do stuff there.\n",
