    "created_at": "2016-03-31T12:16:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-31T12:16:58Z",
    "body": "I would be okay with defining that the size changes from a task and that the events are dispatched before the next frame (I'm assuming vsync is frame).\n",
